WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
A staircase of rank.

2
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.040
A titled family at the top.

3
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:08.810
Then landed gentry, new money,
trade and the professions.

4
00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.530
At the bottom, uncertain rank: Wickham.

5
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:15.740
A grand carriage pulls
up at a small house.

6
00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.720
Lady Catherine de Bourgh
has come to Longbourn.

7
00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:23.260
To her, Elizabeth has no
family, connections, or fortune.

8
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:26.500
"Are the shades of Pemberley
to be thus polluted?"

9
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.060
She says Elizabeth isn't good enough.

10
00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.700
Does the novel agree?

11
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.740
In this mission, you'll climb
the novel's social ladder,

12
00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:36.840
and see where each
character's status comes from.

13
00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:40.540
You'll learn why pride and
vanity are not the same fault.

14
00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:43.470
And you'll meet Bingley's
two very fine sisters,

15
00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.160
through the narrator's eyes.

16
00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:49.320
Your mission: decide whether the
novel agrees with Lady Catherine.
